    {
      "week": 29,
      "slug": "two-length-builders",
      "title": "Two-length builders",
      "idea": "Reachable rod lengths, a final gap, and finite certificates for infinitely many targets.",
      "gates": "K-1: count and align lengths to 18. Grades 2-3: add to 28 and organize cases. Grades 4-5: multiplication, common factors and remainders for the general questions.",
      "materials": "Matching-scale rods or paper strips, graph paper, ruler, pencil and scissors. Rods may be reused between targets. Test rod fit against the printed scale.",
      "pretest": "Measure the actual rod and print scales before placing rods on a page; this physical fit test has not been performed.",
